  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize 'Junk' (Pi) cards that contain the 'Shakes' or 'Bombs'. In Matgo, Junk cards are often the easiest way to hit the 7-point threshold. Don't chase Brights if you are missing the easier 10-Junk point.\n\nThe Paulownia (Dec) and Rain (Nov) months are powerful. Paulownia junk cards are doubled, and 'Rain' cards are essential for certain high-scoring Yaku. Block your opponent from completing 'Godori' (Birds) at all costs.\n\nMultipliers: If you 'Go' three times, your score is tripled. Only 'Go' if you have a guaranteed path to more points and your opponent has fewer than 5 points. If they hit 7 before you win, they 'Stop' and take all your potential winnings.",
    Player: "Prioritize 'Junk' (Pi) cards that contain the 'Shakes' or 'Bombs'. In Matgo, Junk cards are often the easiest way to hit the 7-point threshold. Don't chase Brights if you are missing the easier 10-Junk point.\n\nThe Paulownia (Dec) and Rain (Nov) months are powerful. Paulownia junk cards are doubled, and 'Rain' cards are essential for certain high-scoring Yaku. Block your opponent from completing 'Godori' (Birds) at all costs.\n\nMultipliers: If you 'Go' three times, your score is tripled. Only 'Go' if you have a guaranteed path to more points and your opponent has fewer than 5 points. If they hit 7 before you win, they 'Stop' and take all your potential winnings.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
    riskTolerance: 0.5,
