    basic: "Prioritize 'Junk' (Pi) cards that contain the 'Shakes' or 'Bombs'. In Matgo, Junk cards are often the easiest way to hit the 7-point threshold. Don't chase Brights if you are missing the easier 10-Junk point.",
    intermediate: "The Paulownia (Dec) and Rain (Nov) months are powerful. Paulownia junk cards are doubled, and 'Rain' cards are essential for certain high-scoring Yaku. Block your opponent from completing 'Godori' (Birds) at all costs.",
    advanced: "Multipliers: If you 'Go' three times, your score is tripled. Only 'Go' if you have a guaranteed path to more points and your opponent has fewer than 5 points. If they hit 7 before you win, they 'Stop' and take all your potential winnings.",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Shake: If you have 3 cards of the same month in hand, 'Shake' them to double your points if you win.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Bomb: If you have 3 cards in hand and the 4th is on the table, you can 'Bomb' it to take all and clear the space.",
